a) an integer;

b) a prime.

Find all positive integers $n$ such that the number $F_{n} = \frac{2^{4n+2} - 1}{65}$ is

a) an integer;

b) a prime.

Find all positive integers $n$ such that the number $G_{n} = \frac{2^{4n+2} + 1}{65n}$ is

a) an integer;

b) a prime.

positive_text:
\text{Let } a, b, c \text{ be non-negative real numbers, not all zero. Prove that}
$$
\frac{2a^{2}-a+b+c}{a+b^{2}+c^{2}}+\frac{2b^{2}+a-b+c}{a^{2}+b+c^{2}}+\frac{2c^{2}+a+b-c}{a^{2}+b^{2}+c} \geqslant 3
$$
\text{and find all triples } (a, b, c) \text{ for which equality occurs.}

negatives.text:
\text{Let } x, y, z \geq 0. Prove that}
$$
\frac{2x^{2}+x+y+z}{x+y^{2}+z^{2}}+\frac{2y^{2}+x+y+z}{x^{2}+y+z^{2}}+\frac{2z^{2}+x+y+z}{x^{2}+y^{2}+z} \geqslant 3
$$
\text{and find all triples } (x, y, z) \text{ for which equality occurs.}

\text{Let } x, y, z \geq 0. Prove that}
$$
\frac{2x^{2}-x+y+z}{x+y^{2}+z^{2}}+\frac{2y^{2}+x-y+z}{x^{2}+y+z^{2}}+\frac{2z^{2}+x+y+z}{x^{2}+y^{2}+z} \geqslant 3
$$
\text{and find all triples } (x, y, z) \text{ for which equality occurs.}

\text{Let } x, y, z \geq 0. Prove that}
$$
\frac{2x^{2}-x+y+z}{x+y^{2}+z^{2}}+\frac{2y^{2}-x-y+z}{x^{2}+y+z^{2}}+\frac{2z^{2}+x+y-z}{x^{2}+y^{2}+z} \geqslant 3
$$
\text{and find all triples } (x, y, z) \text{ for which equality occurs.}

positive_text:
Determine all onto functions $ g: \mathbb{Z}^+ \rightarrow \mathbb{Z}^+ $ such that for all $ m, n \in \mathbb{Z}^+ $, exactly one of the following is true:
$$
\begin{aligned}
 g(m) &= g(n) \\
 g(m+n) &= \min \{g(m), g(n)\}
\end{aligned}
$$

negatives.text:
Find all surjective functions $ f: \mathbb{N} \rightarrow \mathbb{N} $ such that for all $ a, b \in \mathbb{N} $, exactly one of the following is true:
$$
\begin{aligned}
 f(a) &= f(b) \\
 f(a+b) &= \max \{f(a), f(b)\}
\end{aligned}
$$

positive_text:
Fie $M$ o matrice pătratică de ordinul $n$, cu toate elementele egale cu $-17$ sau $17$. Determinați cea mai mare valoare a determinantului matricei $M$, pentru:

a) $n=3$;

b) $n=4$.

negatives.text:
Fie $C$ o matrice pătratică de ordinul $n$, având toate elementele egale cu $-1$ sau $1$. Determinați valoarea maximă a determinantului matricei $C$, pentru:

a) $n=3$;

b) $n=2$.

Fie $D$ o matrice pătratică de ordinul $n$, având toate elementele egale cu $-1$ sau $1$. Determinați valoarea minimă a determinantului matricei $D$, pentru:

a) $n=3$;

b) $n=4$.

positive_text:
Bepaal alle drietallen $(x, y, z)$ van positieve gehele getallen met $x+y+z=10$ zodat er $x$ rode, $y$ blauwe en $z$ groene punten (allemaal verschillend) in het vlak bestaan met de volgende eigenschappen:
- de totale afstandssom tussen elk rood en elk blauw punt is $37$;
- de totale afstandssom tussen elk groen en elk rood punt is $30$;
- de totale afstandssom tussen elk blauw en elk groen punt is $1$;

negatives.text:
Bepaal alle drietallen $(a, b, c)$ van positieve gehele getallen met $a+b+c=10$ zodat er $a$ rode, $b$ blauwe en $c$ groene punten (allemaal verschillend) in het vlak bestaan met de volgende eigenschappen:
